# MotorStorm recompilation: what this repository holds is OUR work only (scripts, the
# port's and the launcher's sources, the toolkit's local patches). The game, the firmware and
# everything derived from them (decrypted EBOOT, lifted code, SPU images, extracted or patched
# game files, the built exe) never enter it. So: everything is ignored unless listed here.
# The working notes (docs\, CLAUDE.md) stay local too: the repository is public.
/*
!/.gitignore
!/.gitattributes
!/README.md
!/LICENSE
!/assets/
!/scripts/
!/port/
!/launcher/
!/toolkit/
!/.claude/

# port\: hand-written sources and build / run scripts only.
# Not: spu\ and spu_ms_overlays.c (lifted SPU code), psarc_patches.bin (game menu files,
# rebuilt by scripts\psarc_patch.py from psarc_edits.json), build\, gamedata*\ (saves), logs.
/port/*
!/port/*.cpp
!/port/*.bat
!/port/CMakeLists.txt
!/port/README.md
!/port/config.toml
!/port/func_hooks.txt
!/port/psarc_edits.json
# The 1.06 update build (PORT_V106): its addresses / offsets (title_addrs.h), hook list and menu edits.
!/port/*.h
!/port/func_hooks_106.txt
!/port/psarc_edits_106.json
!/port/duck_fp.hlsl

/scripts/__pycache__/
/scripts/gamedata/
/launcher/src-tauri/gen/
/launcher/src-tauri/target/
# The game's own icon (scripts\make_game_icon.ps1, from the player's ICON0.PNG): never published.
/launcher/src-tauri/icons/game.ico
/.claude/settings.local.json
*.pyc
